{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922061008_7af6c840","chunk_index":21,"job_id":"mwjob_bb370670e7bc8936451212fd","precondition_digest":"4a6e79ad1a018b35e8d9fb9ec3e6615eae80ab09f96c3d0a0d5c5c36ea6962d6","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v9","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_821ddd4ec4423824","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_47144bb8ad86d32f","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1ce08f07f41bcedd","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0685b59028fb9fc4"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922061008_7af6c840","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"避孕的规定与方法","missing_source_classes":["本项目避孕要求与可接受避孕方法来源文件","妊娠检测与妊娠事件管理安排","研究者手册中生殖毒性与避孕时限依据"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"可用来源未定义本项目的避孕方法与规定：已确认事实仅包括目标人群为成人以及妊娠或哺乳期女性不符合入选条件；可接受或不可接受的避孕措施、避孕起止时间、妊娠检测安排及伴侣相关要求均无项目来源支持。共享语料中的避孕条目属于其他药物Ⅰ期方案，不能迁移为本项目规定。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（避孕的规定与方法）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_821ddd4ec4423824","section_number":"14.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2caa01955723fed592fff445","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:6520ebbe09a51d:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846:e7a96b3314e879"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922061008_7af6c840","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要终点：第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。\n关键次要终点：第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例。；第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例。\n其他次要终点：第16周PASI评分较基线的变化。；第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"ba197eabab40b7879a440065c2250c0972b6f127dcd39f273ef81d0cdb8222df","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_proj_endpoints"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_proj_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"入选标准模块：年龄≥18岁；确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月；筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3；适合接受系统治疗或光疗。\n排除标准模块：非斑块型银屑病为主要表现，或存在可能干扰疗效/安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病；活动性严重感染；妊娠或哺乳期；研究者判断不适合参加。","quote_sha256":"1d70a00668fc29405cd9e7074e0a2356b48c658e6ae505a379b7f3a256fcce59","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_proj_eligibility"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要研究目的：评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。\n次要研究目的：评价合成试验药A对皮损清除程度及皮肤病相关生活质量的影响。","quote_sha256":"2ac5414e5b404b58a36cba216311b70c374adcc64fbb813ea19e5451f68e54f8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_proj_objectives"}],"evidence_span_ids":["sp_proj_endpoints","sp_proj_visits","sp_proj_eligibility","sp_proj_objectives"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"研究量表和评价工具","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究采用PASI、sPGA和DLQI作为疗效与皮肤病相关生活质量的评价工具。PASI评分用于评价银屑病疾病严重程度并计算治疗应答，主要终点为第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例；关键次要终点包括第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例，以及第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例。其他次要终点包括第16周PASI评分较基线的变化与第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化，DLQI用于评价皮肤病相关生活质量。筛选及基线时采用PASI、受累体表面积和sPGA评估疾病严重程度，入选要求为PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3。PASI和sPGA在基线及第4、8、12、16周进行评价，评价结果用于主要终点、关键次要终点及其他次要终点的分析。","rationale":"依据已确认终点、访视策略与入选标准撰写，并直接写入各量表评价时点与终点原值。医学作者需核对量表版本与使用授权、评分培训与评估者安排、DLQI的具体采集时点（来源仅给出第16周较基线变化这一终点，不能由此新增采集时点），以及量表评价结果的记录方式。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_47144bb8ad86d32f","section_number":"14.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2caa01955723fed592fff445","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:6520ebbe09a51d:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846:e7a96b3314e879"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922061008_7af6c840","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"实验室检查项目","missing_source_classes":["实验室检查项目与采样时点项目文件","中心实验室或检测机构手册","研究药物非临床及临床安全性资料中的实验室监测要求"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"可用来源确认实验室检查具有临床意义的变化属于安全性终点，但未列出实验室检查项目、采样时点、检测机构及异常值处理要求，也未提供需依据研究药物特性重点监测的实验室指标。缺少上述项目来源，本节无法在不臆造检查清单与采样安排的情况下形成正文。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1ce08f07f41bcedd","section_number":"14.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2caa01955723fed592fff445","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:6520ebbe09a51d:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846:e7a96b3314e879"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922061008_7af6c840","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"安全信息报告途径","missing_source_classes":["AE/SAE/SUSAR定义与报告时限项目文件","安全性信息报告流程与报告接收方安排","监管快速报告要求与安全性数据交换文件"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"可用来源确认安全性终点包括TEAE、严重不良事件、导致停药的不良事件发生率，以及实验室检查、生命体征与12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化；但未提供AE/SAE/SUSAR定义、报告对象、报告时限与报告流程等项目文件，缺少可据以撰写安全信息报告途径的来源。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（安全信息报告途径）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0685b59028fb9fc4","section_number":"14.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:2caa01955723fed592fff445","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:6520ebbe09a51d:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846:e7a96b3314e879"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:2caa01955723fed592fff445","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:2caa01955723fed592fff445","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"bd690f46e4f91959a486b68a6fdafd159e6d4a09a9f390d00ad497449c889edf"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:附录1.避孕的规定与方法|block:971|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:6520ebbe09a51d:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846","source_type":"company